-- Creatures that never spawned: a creature whose chosen display has no creature_model_info row is not loaded at all
-- (Creature::InitEntry "has invalid model ... can't load"). 472 displays that creature_template_model uses and that ARE in
-- the client (CreatureDisplayInfo.db2) had no row, among them the Forever NPCs Sentinel Eralya Leafshadow (148339),
-- Brakk (144648), Kaga Wildhoof (144649) and Lyreena Duskblade (144650); about 480 spawned creature entries were affected
-- (Discord reports: Brakk, Lyreena and Eralya missing; .npc near listed the spawns, nothing stood there).
-- Values:
-- - 440 displays: copied from the existing rows of other displays on the same client model (CreatureDisplayInfo.ModelID),
--   the most common value, scaled by each display's CreatureModelScale.
-- - 30 displays whose model has no other display with a row: INFERRED from CreatureModelData.CollisionWidth times the
--   scales, with the ratios that hold for the 11,270 rows we have (bounding radius 0.5727 x width, combat reach 2.4545 x width,
--   the medians).
-- - 2 displays without a usable collision width: the player defaults 0.389 / 1.5.
-- Safe to run again.
